<title>PORTUGAL: Portucel to issue H1 results on Friday.</title>
<headline>Portucel to issue H1 results on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pulp group Portucel Industrial-Empresa Produtora de Celulose said it brought forward the issue of its first half results to Friday July 18 from the previously announced July 31.</p>
<p>The figures will be issued at the close of share trading at 1530 GMT.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
